---
title: "Texas Aerial Robotics | Autonomous drones built at UT Austin"
description: "Texas Aerial Robotics is an undergraduate research organization at the University of Texas at Austin dedicated to designing, building, and programming fully autonomous drones."
ogTitle: "Texas Aerial Robotics"
ogDescription: "Autonomous drones, built by students at The University of Texas at Austin."
navKey: "home"
---

  <!-- ===============================================================
       HERO — brand-first, one job, full-bleed atmosphere
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__sky" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero__beam"></div>
      <div class="hero__gridlines"></div>
      <svg class="hero__paths" viewBox="0 0 1200 800" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
        <path class="hero__path hero__path--a" d="M-40 520 C 220 420, 380 610, 620 480 S 980 320, 1240 400" fill="none" />
        <path class="hero__path hero__path--b" d="M-20 180 C 260 260, 420 80, 680 160 S 1020 280, 1240 120" fill="none" />
        <path class="hero__path hero__path--c" d="M100 760 C 340 640, 520 720, 760 600 S 1080 520, 1300 560" fill="none" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="container hero__layout">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="hero__brand">Texas Aerial Robotics</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          Flight that thinks<br />
          for <em>itself</em>.
        </h1>
        <p class="lede hero__lede">
          UT Austin undergraduates designing, building, and programming
          fully autonomous drones &mdash; airframe to autonomy stack.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/projects.html">See the fleet</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/about.html">Meet the lab</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__stage" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit">
          <span class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--outer"></span>
          <span class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--mid"></span>
          <span class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--inner"></span>
          <span class="orbit__ping"></span>
          <img
            class="orbit__mark"
            src="/assets/brand/logos/tar-logo-primary-dark-tight.png"
            alt=""
            width="420"
            height="287"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="orbit__caption">
          <span class="orbit__dot"></span>
          Autonomy stack live
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Telemetry strip — intentionally below the first screen -->
  <section class="telemetry" aria-label="Team snapshot">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="telemetry__rail">
        <div class="telemetry__item">
          <span class="telemetry__key">Founded</span>
          <span class="telemetry__val">2017</span>
        </div>
        <div class="telemetry__item">
          <span class="telemetry__key">Members</span>
          <span class="telemetry__val">40+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="telemetry__item">
          <span class="telemetry__key">Sub-teams</span>
          <span class="telemetry__val">9</span>
        </div>
        <div class="telemetry__item">
          <span class="telemetry__key">Active builds</span>
          <span class="telemetry__val">4</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       WHO ARE WE?
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
          <hr class="rule" />
          <h2>An undergraduate lab for autonomous flight.</h2>
          <p class="lede">
            Based at The University of Texas at Austin, Texas Aerial
            Robotics designs, builds, and programs drones that fly
            themselves.
          </p>
          <p class="lede">
            Members ship with the same tools used in industry: CAD,
            prototyping, Linux, C++, ROS, and computer vision.
          </p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/about.html">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel panel--signal reveal">
          <p class="panel__title">Stack we train on</p>
          <ul class="tags">
            <li class="tag">CAD</li>
            <li class="tag">Prototyping</li>
            <li class="tag">PCB Design</li>
            <li class="tag">Embedded</li>
            <li class="tag">Avionics</li>
            <li class="tag">Linux</li>
            <li class="tag">C++</li>
            <li class="tag">Python</li>
            <li class="tag">ROS</li>
            <li class="tag">PX4</li>
            <li class="tag">Vision</li>
            <li class="tag">Planning</li>
            <li class="tag">SLAM</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       PROJECTS — editorial mission list, not a card grid
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ site.season }} missions</span>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <h2>What we are building this year.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Every member joins a project team and ships real hardware with
          real software beside it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="missions">
        {%- for project in projects.current %}
        <a
          class="mission reveal"
          href="/projects.html#{{ project.link }}"
        >
          <span class="mission__index">{{ project.label }}</span>
          <span class="mission__body">
            <span class="mission__name">{{ project.name }}</span>
            <span class="mission__summary">{{ project.summary }}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mission__go" aria-hidden="true">View</span>
        </a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       TAR AT RTX
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--dark section--grid">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">TAR at RTX</span>
          <hr class="rule" />
          <h2>Competing on a national stage.</h2>
          <p class="lede">
            Our RAVG team races in the RTX Autonomous Vehicles Competition,
            pairing aerial and ground robots in fast, strategic arenas.
          </p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/ravg.html"
              >Explore the RAVG team</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel reveal">
          <p class="panel__title">This year's mission</p>
          <ul class="list-check">
            {%- for step in ravg.steps %}
            <li><strong>{{ step.step }}.</strong> {{ step.detail }}</li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       PARTNERS
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header section__header--center">
        <span class="eyebrow">Partners</span>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <h2>Sponsors who keep us flying.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Licenses, parts, and funding from these partners become flight
          hours for undergraduates building autonomous systems.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-wall reveal">
        <div class="logo-slot">
          <img src="/assets/company/platinum/Altium_logo.svg" alt="Altium" />
        </div>
        <div class="logo-slot">
          <img src="/assets/company/platinum/ANSYS_logo.png" alt="ANSYS" />
        </div>
        <div class="logo-slot">
          <img
            src="/assets/company/platinum/Solidworks_logo.webp"
            alt="Solidworks"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="logo-slot">
          <img
            src="/assets/company/gold/ASE_Logo.svg"
            alt="UT Aerospace Engineering"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content: center">
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/partners.html"
          >Partnership tiers</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       CALL TO ACTION
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p class="cta-band__brand">Texas Aerial Robotics</p>
      <h2>Join a team that ships flying robots.</h2>
      <p>
        No experience required &mdash; just curiosity. We train new members
        on the tools, and everyone works on a real project from day one.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact.html">Get in touch</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/donate.html">Support the team</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
